# The root .gitignore excludes `*.app` under "Executables" (macOS bundles). That
# pattern also matches the DIRECTORY `PicoSwitch.Companion.App`, which would
# silently drop the entire WinUI project from version control. Git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so the directory itself
# has to be un-excluded first -- and this negation must come BEFORE the build
# output rules below, because the last matching pattern wins.
!companion/src/PicoSwitch.Companion.App/

# .NET build output. The Windows companion is built from source on every
# machine; nothing under these directories is an input to anything.
bin/
obj/

# Local MSIX signing material must never reach version control (WINDOWS_PASS.md §27.2).
*.pfx
*.snk
